00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:53,360
 All right, so this is a test of our knowledge of periapical diagnoses.

224
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:59,040
 So we basically have a bunch of different descriptions of the different periapical diagnoses

225
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:03,720
 here and then we have our right answer somewhere in between them.

